Z||000000||Fformula88||07-19-2000||09:33 PM||||Does anyone have an itinerary for the FOCOA nationals in Louisville.  I cannot find anything online, and I haven't gotten my mag. yet from them.  Its on the way, but I really would like to get everything finalized now.  If anyone has the link, or the info they can give me I'd appreciate it.  Thanks everyone!||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||07-19-2000||09:40 PM||||According to Gloria, "Thursday is registration and classification of your car.  Thurs night I think there is going to be a local cruise.  Friday at 12:00 we all go onto<BR>the riverboat for a cruise down/up the river (we'll have discount coupons at<BR>registration) and Friday night will be the hospitality room with Fiero hot<BR>wheel races etc. The car show is on Saturday. <P>The banquet is on Sat night and that is where the car show awards are given out."<P>Also, last I heard, several of them are staying over til Sunday and taking a tour of Ft. Knox before departing for home.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||tgowens||07-19-2000||09:43 PM||||oh, I haven't seen any specific times for any of the events but I guess we'll find out when we get there -- you are right - there is virtually nothing on the internet and I have already read the magazine - nothing there either concerning specific times.||||reg||1
